        "TileImage": "$($repository 799e5b66-b968-4ecf-b2f5-a99a892138fe).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings 47, it seems Kohn was impressed with your work and has reached out again for our assistance. It seems that the investigation into his law firm and its shady connections is becoming something of a concern for Mr. Kohn. You&apos;ll have to take out Ruby Red, whose investigation may put everything in the open, Fabian Mann who seems to be catching on to account discrepancies, and Mr. Jackson, recently fired over — of all things — a sweater. Petty, but a bitter man could talk. Good luck, 47.",
